//! stage: lex
// Imaginary literals are decimal and take `j`, `j16`, `j32` or `j64` (§2.5.2).
a 0x1j //~ ERROR imaginary literals are decimal
b 0b1j //~ ERROR imaginary literals are decimal
c 2j8 //~ ERROR invalid suffix `j8` for an imaginary literal; expected j, j16, j32 or j64
d 1.5j128 //~ ERROR invalid suffix `j128` for an imaginary literal
